    φ₂ ∈ SB (Fin n × Fin d → Fv F v) → Acts (evFin F v) (M.co.rho B.ψ u) φ φ₁ → Acts (evFin F v) (om x) φ φ₂ →
    Acts (evFin F v) (om x) φ₁ φ₃ → Acts (evFin F v) (M.co.rho B.ψ (mat x.1 * u * (mat x.2)ᵀ)) φ₂ φ₄ → φ₄ = φ₃ := by
